This is a program to complete partial calendar information.  It relates
the year, month, day, day of the week, week of the month, day of the year 
and julian day.  Given all this information, it will confirm the relation.
Given part of this information, it will attempt to fill in the missing data.
It combines a number of previously published programs into one.  Since it
is sensitive to the range of integer arithmetic a set of tests results is
included.  Please send bugs and suggestions to the author.

